  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She is first named when the academy year-end cultivation check calls Gu Yue Jin Zhu from the list. A young girl walks forward with a nervous expression, and the examiner declares rank one middle stage. That check sits inside the Gu Yue clan academy with the clan leader and elders present before the arena exam.",
      "chapters": [
        81
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The clan’s early stage is Qing Mao Mountain in the Southern Border.",
      "chapters": [
        4
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a young girl. At the year-end cultivation check she walks forward with a nervous expression.",
      "chapters": [
        81
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the arena she walks up with a serious expression.",
      "chapters": [
        82
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the year-end examination she faces Gu Yue Mo Bei. Both open with moonblades while moving and evading. She has good basic skills and fights him evenly for a while, then loses stamina, is suppressed, and surrenders soaked in sweat while Mo Bei is barely tired.",
      "chapters": [
        82
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-end-arena",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_yue_mo_bei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later recalls that same arena match and names her a hardworking girl.",
      "chapters": [
        97
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-end-arena",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the small beast tide stretch, Mo Bei tells Fang Yuan that today is a group memorial assembly and that Gu Yue Jin Zhu is dead. Fang Zheng, Chi Cheng, and other youths walk with him, and Fang Zheng says Jin Zhu studied with them for a year. Mo Bei and Chi Cheng set aside their usual hatred to walk together to that memorial. Beside that death notice, Fang Yuan only recalls her even arena fight with Mo Bei and that she was a hardworking girl.",
      "chapters": [
        97
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_gu_yue_chi_cheng"
      ]
    }
  ],
